<title>UK: FUND VIEW - Chase sees two-tier Japan stockmarket.</title>
<headline>FUND VIEW - Chase sees two-tier Japan stockmarket.</headline>
<byline>David Chance</byline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Despite the doom and gloom surrounding the fall in the Nikkei-225 share index to 17,300 points earlier this month and slide from a rally over 18,000 points this week, some investors are convinced value can be found in Japan, even in a bear market.</p>
